  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">773 Dance Project&apos;s mission is to provide professional-level dance classes, workshops, and performances to Chicago communities on the South and West sides. Access to arts includes those who participate and those who facilitate. This Project will allow us to offer a summer series of 4 dancing in the park classes for free and still be able to pay our teachers a competitive wage.</narrative>
